{
  "layout": "scanned",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "今日はいつにもまして暑いわね",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "こんなに攻撃が激しいのは",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "さっきの女の子がおかしくなっ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ちゃったから？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "甘いわ！",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "そこの紅白！",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "他にもおかしい奴が居るのね？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "おまたせ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "悪魔の妹",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "フランドール・スカーレット",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "誰？前来た時は居なかったような",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "気がするけど・・・",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "居たけど、見えなかったの",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "で、あなたはもしかして人間？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ああ、そうよ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "だましたりしてない？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "人間って飲み物の形でしか見たこと",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "無いの",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ああ、人間だよ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "人間は、紅茶よりは複雑なもの",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "なのよ。殆どの人はね",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ほら、鶏って",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あー？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "捌いたり出来ない人でも",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "美味しく頂けるの",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あんたんところは、人間を誰が",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "捌くの？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "さー？　お姉様がやってる",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "わけ無いし・・・",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "お姉様？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "レプリカとかいう、悪魔のこと？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "レミリア！",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "レミリアお姉様よ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あいつは絶対に、調理は出来ない",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "と思うよ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "しないわ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "妹君に言いたいけど",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "お姉様はいつも家の神社に入り",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "浸って迷惑なの",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "何とか言ってやってよ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "知ってるわよ。",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "私も行こうとしたら・・・",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "するな",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "止められた",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "お外は豪雨で歩けない",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "要注意人物なんだね",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "過去になんかやらかしたの？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "何も出来るはずがないわ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "私は４９５年間一回も、お外に出て",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ないのよ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ほんとに、問題児なのね",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "そこに飛び込む遊び道具・・・",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "何して遊ぶ？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "弾幕ごっこ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ああ、パターン作りごっこね",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "それは私の得意分野だわ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "見た？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "これが神に仕えるものの力なのよ！",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "そんなんで勝ったと思っちゃうんだ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "まだまだこれからよ！",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "って、もうそんな余裕も無いくせに",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "はい、もう、煙も出ません",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "いつでも遊びに来てあげるから",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "頼むから、神社に遊びに来ないで",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あら、お礼にケーキと紅茶を",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "持って行こうと思ってたのに。",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あんたの所の食べ物は人間の所に",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "もってきちゃだめだって",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "甘さ控えめよ？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ノンシュガーでも！",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "良い子はおとなしく帰って",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "寝てなさい",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "・・・ここは私の家よ？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "じゃぁ帰らなくてもいいわ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "悪い子は",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "私はそろそろ帰るけど",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "悪い子は、帰らなくてもいいのよ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "・・・神社にもう一人悪い子",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "置いてきたから",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "悪い子って、誰のこと？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あんたと姉さんだ！！",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "なによ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "また来たの？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "また来たの",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "今日は、喘息も調子良いから、",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "とっておきの魔法",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "見せてあげるわ！",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "どうしちゃったんだ？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "この館",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "今はレミリアは神社に居るはずだぜ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "なんで、こんなに館の攻撃が",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "激しいんだ？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "なんかお呼びかしら？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "呼んでないぜ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "おまたせ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あんた誰？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "人に名前を聞くときは・・・",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ああ、私？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "そうだな、博麗霊夢、巫女だぜ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "フランドールよ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "魔理沙さん（巫女は無理があるわ）",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "悪魔の妹",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "フランドール・スカーレット",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あんた、なにもん？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "（看護婦の方が良かったか？）",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "私はずっと家に居たわ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あなたがこの家に入り浸ってる",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ときもね",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "居たっけ？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ずっと地下で休んでいたわ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "４９５年くらいね",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "いいねぇ、私は週休２日だぜ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "いつもお姉様とやり取りして",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "いるの、聞いていたわ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "お姉様？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "妹君かえ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "私も人間と言うものが見たく",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "なって、外に出ようとしたの",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "良かったじゃないか",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ほれほれ、思う存分見るが良い",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "一緒に遊んでくれるのかしら？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "いくら出す？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "コインいっこ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "一個じゃ、",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "人命も買えないぜ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あなたが、コンティニュー",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "出来ないのさ！",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "さー、満足した？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "嘘みたい",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "私が負けるなんて・・・",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ああ、割と嘘かもな",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "今日は、私はもう帰るけど",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ああ、満足したわ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "でも、結局また一人になるのか",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "一人になったら首を吊るんだろ？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "何でよ？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "She went and hanged herself",
      "encoding": "ascii"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "and then there were none.",
      "encoding": "ascii"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "（一人が首を吊って",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "そして誰もいなくなった）",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "誰からそれを聞いたのよー",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "有名な童謡だぜ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "私の予定では最後の一人は",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あなただったのよ？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "さっきの攻撃で、おまえが",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "消えたときだな",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "She died by the bullet",
      "encoding": "ascii"
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "and then there were none.",
      "encoding": "ascii"
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "（一人が弾幕を避けきれず",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "そして誰もいなくなった）",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "当てが外れて悪かったな。",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
